Purpose: src/lib/graph/graphFormat.test.js loads these files with
import.meta.glob to prove that the Studio graph editor writes an unedited
document back byte-identical and that an edit changes only the lines it
touches. Nothing outside *.test.* files imports them, so they never reach a
build. Refresh them from a newer commons commit by copying the files again
and updating the commit above.

